    "text": "By Joseph W. Smith III ,\n1 days ago One recent Monday out at Muncy’s dandy District, a film-fan friend and I were badly disappointed by Disclosure Day. Ever hopeful for cinematic gold, we shortly thereafter home-streamed the recent sci-fi opus Good Luck, Have Fun, Don’t Die. (We’d missed it theatrically — because it played in Williamsport for just one week.) Read full article",
